      "writtenOn": "2022-02-07T20:27:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does * cover constructors? The proguard manual says:\n\n```\nWILDCARD\tMEANING\n\u003cinit\u003e\tmatches any constructor.\n\u003cfields\u003e\tmatches any field.\n\u003cmethods\u003e\tmatches any method.\n*\tmatches any field or method.\n```\n\nhttps://www.guardsquare.com/manual/configuration/usage#classspecification",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 17,
        "startChar": 32,
        "endLine": 17,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "3295f24ee59c1b9bf3cd9bce0d2af19168ae8342",
